    Lines:
      Loved:
      - 'Mackerel! Half for the bait tubs and half for the pan, and I will argue with myself all day about which half.'
      Liked:
      - 'Smelts. My mother fried them by the plateful every spring. Thank you, dear.'
      Neutral:
      - 'Thank you. I will not ask where it came from.'
      Disliked:
      - 'Tomcod. I sell bait to people who are trying their best not to catch these.'
